  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "Commander, have you seen the latest refit for the Boreas? It's the R variant, also known as the Amirault, and let me tell you, I am impressed! The frame is made of Endo Steel, which means it's lighter and more maneuverable, and the weapons have been replaced with a Bunch LRM 15 launchers n a couple Clan ER Medium Lasers. Can you imagine the kind of firepower this mech can unleash? I can't wait to see this baby in action!",
